      Image aliases for all game artwork. Every entry points at its own built-in illustration (ffart_*).
      To use real artwork for one entry (for example ff_char_alok):
        1. Put ff_char_alok.webp (or .png) in res/drawable-nodpi/
        2. Delete the matching <item> line below.
      No Kotlin or layout change is needed.
    -->

